# core.autocrlf rewrites line endings in anything Git thinks is text. A PDF or a DOCX
# containing the same bytes comes back corrupted, and the corruption only shows up when
# somebody clones the repo on another machine and ingestion fails on their copy.
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary

# The text formats are checked out with the platform's own line endings
*.md   text
*.txt  text
*.csv  text
*.html text
*.json text
*.py   text
*.yml  text
